# Scheduled jobs (spec §6). Times are local — the container runs with TZ=Europe/Warsaw.
# Logs go to stdout: docker compose logs -f cron
#
# Migrations are deliberately absent: the app service runs them at startup, and an
# unattended job must never change the schema.

0 5 * * * python manage.py fetch_weather
0 7 * * * python manage.py recompute_statuses
30 7 * * * python manage.py send_digests
